   - MaximumPrincipleRN: weak_maximum_principle — check hypotheses are genuine (open, bounded, nonempty, subsolution data...). This one has hypotheses by nature (it's a conditional theorem: subsolution implies bounded). "Unconditional" means no smuggled axioms — the hypotheses are the actual math ones.
